### Create a Standalone Application with NestFactory.createApplicationContext

Source: https://github.com/nestjs/docs.nestjs.com/blob/master/content/application-context.md

Initializes a Nest standalone application without network listeners by wrapping the Nest IoC container. Use this construction to run standalone scripts, CRON jobs, or CLI tools.

```typescript
@@filename()
async function bootstrap() {
  const app = await NestFactory.createApplicationContext(AppModule);
  // your application logic here ...
}
await bootstrap();
```

